  "text": "The author of the 'Harry Potter' series is J.K. Rowling.\n\nFor the rectangle problem:\nGiven:\n1. Length $l = 2w$\n2. Area $A = l \\times w$\n\nSubstituting $l$ in the area formula:\n$A = (2w) \\times w = 2w^2$\n\nAlternatively, expressing in terms of $l$:\nSince $w = l/2$,\n$A = l \\times (l/2) = l^2 / 2$\n\nThus, the area $A$ can be expressed as $2w^2$ or $l^2 / 2$."
